    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a piece of armour covering the breast (OED s.v. breast n. 2.b) | the piece of armor covering the breast (OED s.v. brest n. 2b) | a piece of armor covering the breast (OED s.v. breast n. 2.b) | breast is a piece of armour covering the breast (OED s.v. breast n. 2 b), but the exact meaning of 'double' in this context is unknown | a piece of armor for protecting the breast (OED s.v. breast-plate) | the piece of armor for protecting the breast (OED s.v. brest-plate n. 2b), here black in color | a piece of armor for protecting the breast (OED s.v. breast-plate), here black in color</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
